      "writtenOn": "2019-06-10T17:25:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Might as well add Name string `blueprint:\"mutated\"` to packageProperties instead of resusing the otherwise unused nameProperties.  Setting values in property structs that are not reported to blueprint can cause confusion if a mutator calls CreateVariations, because blueprint won\u0027t know to clone the value of nameProperties.  That\u0027s unlikely to ever happen here, but best not to use that pattern in case it gets propagated somewhere where it matters.",
