      "writtenOn": "2019-06-13T13:24:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The semantics of the packageInfo() function would be a bit different taking this approach. Currently, when it is called by the visibility module it could return nil if it did not find a PackageInfo. However, switching to this would mean that packageInfo() always return a valid, albeit it empty, PackageInfo object. Is that creation of lots of PackageInfo objects going to be an issue?",
